{"name":"Feldgrau","hex":"#4d5d53","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"feldgrau","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The greenish-grey colour of German military uniforms.","A German soldier who wears a uniform of this colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/feldgrau"}],"entries":[{"title":"Feldgrau","blocks":[{"text":"Feldgrau is a green–grey color. It was the official basic color of military uniforms of the German armed forces from the early 20th century until 1945 or 1989. Armed forces of other countries also used various shades of that color. Feldgrau was used to refer to the color of uniforms of the armies of Germany, first the Imperial German Army and later the Heer of the Reichswehr and the Wehrmacht."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Bundesarchiv_Bild_169-0952%2C_Russland%2C_bei_Stalingrad%2C_Offiziersbesprechung.jpg/330px-Bundesarchiv_Bild_169-0952%2C_Russland%2C_bei_Stalingrad%2C_Offiziersbesprechung.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Feldgrau"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/BW_Dienstanzug_Heer.jpg/120px-BW_Dienstanzug_Heer.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/BW_Dienstanzug_Heer.jpg/250px-BW_Dienstanzug_Heer.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/BW_Dienstanzug_Heer.jpg/120px-BW_Dienstanzug_Heer.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Service dress in Hellgrau (German Bundeswehr)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABW_Dienstanzug_Heer.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/The_pike-grey_field_service_Kappe_%28cap%29%2C_2010.jpg/500px-The_pike-grey_field_service_Kappe_%2